# Normalise to LF in the repository and on checkout, on every platform.
#
# This matters more than usual here: the career dataset is supposed to be the
# supplied file byte for byte, and a CRLF checkout on Windows would quietly change
# its bytes. Keeping LF everywhere means a clone can be verified against the
# original with a checksum.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Third-party minified libraries: never touch them.
assets/vendor/* -text -diff
